f the U.S. Treasury's total outstanding public marketable interest-bearing securities \n# as of ownership survey data recorded on January 31, 1964, converted to INR for 1965 to 1964\"\n\n# This is a bit ambiguous. Let me interpret it as:\n# The question asks about the ratio of securities converted to INR for two different years\n\n# Actually, let me search for the exact historical rates to be sure\nprint(\"Need to find exact annual average USD/INR rates for 1964, 1965, 1966\")\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
